# Bench Grind Combo at Dolores Park: the seat wall 50-50 (sf-gap-seatwall), then a manual from the
# landing for two seconds and an ollie out of it: BS 50-50 + DOLORES SEAT WALL + Manual, 2,733 points
# started at the planters, with the seat wall in it. (The park-wide Dolores Park Show-off goes too.)
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -233.805 -199.578 9.400 -5.33
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x -0.4179
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 4.4806
hold ollie 92..122
tap grind 129
tap up 284
tap down 289
hold ollie 520..528
bot balance
run 700
expect event gap{id=dolores_seatwall} within 226..230
expect event manualStart within 288..292
expect event manualEnd{reason=ollie} within 527..531
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + DOLORES SEAT WALL + Manual,points=2733} within 625..629
expect event goalComplete{id=dolorescombo,name=Bench Grind Combo at Dolores Park} within 625..629
expect no event bail
